</math>-sided die is <math alttext="14"><mn>14</mn>
</math>. The number of possible outcomes for rolling a <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math> is <math alttext="1"><mn>1</mn>
</math>. The probability of rolling a <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math> is the number of possible outcomes for rolling a <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math> divided by the total number of possible outcomes, or <math alttext="one fourteenth"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>
<p>Choice B is incorrect. This is the probability of rolling a number no greater than <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math>.</p>
<p>Choice C is incorrect. This is the probability of rolling a number greater than <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math>.</p>
<p>Choice D is incorrect. This is the probability of rolling a number other than <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math>.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$manifold$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"eccbf957","external_id":"444b9b7a-9594-422f-b8a2-4e0df96ad5da","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":"d1c9c48a-1764-424a-ba2b-baece6acd4d2","uId":"02e8f9d1-b7e9-4468-b903-a16d5b42bd71","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"Q","domain":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","skill_cd":"Q.E.","skill_desc":"Probability and conditional probability","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":2,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Each face of a fair <math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math>-sided die is labeled with a number from <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> through <math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math>, with a different number appearing on each face. If the die is rolled one time, what is the probability of rolling a <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math>?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"3f250efc-aae1-4823-a9ba-f3be9d2cd49c","content":"<p><math alttext=\"one fourteenth\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>1</mn>\n\t<mn>14</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"8515ec06-7ea3-44d4-8873-b458aca6bd42","content":"<p><math alttext=\"two fourteenths\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"15a90e6e-d6a4-4770-bbd0-aa13121f7e88","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 12 Over 14 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"b4c6d376-77a4-4efe-9871-088734b8c503","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 13 Over 14 EndFraction\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>13</mn>\n\t<mn>14</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math></p>"}],"keys":["3f250efc-aae1-4823-a9ba-f3be9d2cd49c"],"correct_answer":["A"],"rationale":"<p>Choice A is correct. The total number of possible outcomes for rolling a fair <math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math>-sided die is <math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math>. The number of possible outcomes for rolling a <math alt