<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$manifold$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"f46139df","external_id":"40d9d60a-1c6b-4ed3-82e1-5d956fe9153a","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":"11151942-1d8b-4870-8485-035957767df8","uId":"3cd3c9d2-d445-498b-aa29-b274adffdded","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"Q","domain":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","skill_cd":"Q.D.","skill_desc":"Two-variable data: Models and scatterplots","difficulty":"M","score_band_range_cd":4,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The scatterplot shows the relationship between two variables, <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>. A line of best fit for the data is also shown.</p>\n<p style=\"justify-content: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"312.748\" height=\"268.328\" viewBox=\"0 0 312.748 268.328\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A scatterplot. The x axis ranges from 0 to 36 in increments of 1, with values marked every 2 grid lines. A break in the axis indicates values between 0 and 23 have been omitted. The y axis ranges from 0 to 12 in increments of 1, with values marked every 2 grid lines. Refer to long description.\"><g id=\"b552b3ab-4b1e-410f-a645-43b755120642\" data-name=\"Layer 1\"><line x1=\"140.385\" y1=\"251.666\" x2=\"140.385\" y2=\"240.332\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.945\"></line><line x1=\"105.506\" y1=\"251.666\" x2=\"105.506\" y2=\"240.332\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.945\"></line><line x1=\"70.627\" y1=\"251.666\" x2=\"70.627\" y2=\"240.332\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.945\"></line><line x